 ## To-Do API using FastAPI

## Description
This project is a RESTful API for managing To-Do tasks using FastAPI. It includes endpoints to create, read, update, and delete To-Do items. Tasks are classified by priority levels (LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH) defined using an `IntEnum`. The API handles validation and efficient data management with Pydantic models.

## Features
- CRUD operations for To-Do items
- Task prioritization with `IntEnum`
- FastAPI for lightweight and efficient API development
- Error handling via HTTP exceptions

## Technologies Used
- Python 3.9+
- FastAPI
- Pydantic
- Uvicorn

